license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Two first-party open datasets documenting Parle: French Pronunciation:
  a bounded 35-entry beginner French sound inventory and a 120-mission
  A0-A2 speaking course map, plus a printable teacher-reference PDF. The CSV
  files are unchanged from v2026.08.11. This is product documentation and open
  educational material, not an independent review, linguistic standard,
  assessment, certification, or endorsement. The DOI is the Zenodo concept DOI;
  no Zenodo v2026.08.27 archive is claimed.
keywords:
